{"ID":"20240506100115-f3zx02e","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506100115-f3zx02e","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100115-f3zx02e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627153223-g0vdjhw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612153625-pxy3u0a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627153325-9m82wwd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"255石灰","type":"doc","updated":"20240822092349"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240627153223-g0vdjhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627153223-g0vdjhw","updated":"20240822092311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石灰石"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石灰石-20240822092257-ibfvc6p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627153325-9m82wwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627153325-9m82wwd","updated":"20240822092308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 511px;","style":"width: 501px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石灰石"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石灰石-20240627153325-okddyee.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 501px;\" parent-style=\"width: 511px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822092349-8kpykck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822092349-8kpykck","updated":"20240822092349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石灰石 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石灰石 1-20240822092349-ndgjcny.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612153622-xyhtxus","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153622-xyhtxus"}},{"ID":"20240612153900-hldkcno","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153900-hldkcno","updated":"20240612153904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153900-kbyintx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153900-kbyintx","updated":"20240612153900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153900-rj448xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153900-rj448xc","updated":"20240612153900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主疽疡疥搔，热气，恶创，癞疾，死肌，堕眉，杀痔虫，去黑子息肉。一名恶疢.生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153900-lnfn1sk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153900-lnfn1sk","updated":"20240612153900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名希疢，生中山。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153900-3whmo0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153900-3whmo0w","updated":"20240612153900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按恶灰，疑当为垩灰，希、石、声之缓急。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153957-vhpp1c6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153957-vhpp1c6"}},{"ID":"20240612153958-erz8d8l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153958-erz8d8l","updated":"20240612154008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153958-1ltuxqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153958-1ltuxqb","updated":"20240612153958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温。主治疽疡，疥瘙，热气，恶疮，癞疾，死肌，堕眉，杀痔虫，去黑子息肉。治髓骨疽。一名恶灰，一名希灰。生中山川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153958-n5mfjty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153958-n5mfjty","updated":"20240612153958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中山属代郡。今近山生石，青白色，作灶烧竟，以水沃之，则热蒸而解末矣。性至烈，人以度酒饮之，则腹痛下痢，治金疮亦甚良。世名石垩。古今多以构冢，用捍水而辟虫。故古冢中水，以洗诸恶疮，皆即瘥也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153939-siobla1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153939-siobla1"}},{"ID":"20240612153940-imsjst7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153940-imsjst7","updated":"20240612153948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153940-zxa26e5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153940-zxa26e5","updated":"20240612153940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰（专入肝、脾）禀壮火之烈，性非温柔，味非甘缓。其治亦属肌肤骨髓，疮疡恶毒，时行热气，刀刃金伤，痄腮肿毒等症。其药只属外敷，而内竟不用及，则知性气之烈，无是过也。故书所言能去黑子息肉堕眉者，以其火气未散，性能灼物故也。书言能主疽疡疥瘙，热气恶疮，癞疾死肌附骨疽者，以其风热毒气，浸淫于骨肉皮肤之间，得此辛温以散之也。（汪昂曰：有人脚肚生一疮，久遂成漏，百药不效，自度必死。一村人见之曰：此鳝漏也，以石灰温炮熏洗，觉痒即是也。洗不数次，遂愈。）书言能蚀恶肉而生新肉者，以其燥能化湿，而肉自克生新之意也。书言能治金疮者，以其性能坚物，使不腐坏，且血见灰即止之意也。（时珍曰：石灰止血神品也，但不可着水，着水即烂肉。）但气味辛烈，其用敷治，务必视症酌施。如杀痔虫等症，则必用以乌头炮等为丸。敷刀斧伤，则必用以牛胆，以灰纳于胆内阴干。点疣痣去根，则必和白糯米蒸透。止泻痢崩带阴挺，则必煎水洗收。造酒味酸，则必投以少许即解。救溺死，则必用化过洗灰下衬，以渗其水，总皆燥湿止血散血之味耳。风化自裂者良，圹灰火毒已出，主顽疮脓水淋漓，敛疮尤妙。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153911-pmlhfw9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153911-pmlhfw9"}},{"ID":"20240612153912-bakfou2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153912-bakfou2","updated":"20240612153921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153926-0eu3xw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153926-0eu3xw4","updated":"20240612153926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治髓骨疽。一名希灰。生中山。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153926-aab3plv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153926-aab3plv","updated":"20240612153926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又，疗金疮，止血大效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153926-txzhqlb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153926-txzhqlb","updated":"20240612153926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文：石灰，味辛，温。主疽疡疥瘙，热气，恶疮癞疾，死肌堕眉，杀痔虫，去黑子息肉。一名恶灰。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153622-hrk036l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153622-hrk036l"}},{"ID":"20240612153843-zzboib1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153843-zzboib1","updated":"20240612153854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153843-hntf8kg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153843-hntf8kg","updated":"20240612153849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"锻石，生中山川谷，今所在近山处皆有之。此烧青石为灰也，又名石锻。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153843-zh8e0zm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153843-zh8e0zm","updated":"20240612153843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有两种∶风化、水化。风化者，取锻了石，置风中自解，此为有力。水化者，以水沃之，则热蒸而解，力差劣。古方多用合百草团末，治金创殊胜。今医家或以腊月黄牛胆，取汁搜和，却内胆中，挂之当风百日，研之更胜草叶者。又败般茹灰，刮取用亦同。又冬灰，生方谷川泽。浣衣黄灰，烧诸蒿藜积聚炼作之。今用灰，多杂薪蒸乃不善。惟桑薪灰，纯者入药绝奇。古方以诸灰杂锻石熬煎，以点疣、痣、黑子等，丹灶亦用之。又锻铁灶中灰，主坚积，古方二车丸用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153843-sfykw3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153843-sfykw3v","updated":"20240612153843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"灶中对釜月下黄土，名伏龙肝。灶额上墨，名百草霜，并主消化积滞，今人下食药中多用之。铛下墨、梁上尘，并主金创。屋尘煤，治齿断肿出血。东壁土，主下部疮、脱肛，皆医家常用，故并见此。伤寒黑奴丸，用釜底墨、灶突墨、梁上尘三物，同合诸药，盖其功用亦相近矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153622-8k6peuk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153622-8k6peuk"}},{"ID":"20240612153834-w8vih41","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153834-w8vih41","updated":"20240612153838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153834-2r3lyhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153834-2r3lyhu","updated":"20240612153834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"重，燥湿，止血，生肌"}]},{"ID":"20240612153834-3me7htv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153834-3me7htv","updated":"20240612153834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛温性烈。能坚物散血，定痛生肌，止金疮血（腊月用黄牛胆汁和，纳胆中，阴干用），杀疮虫（有人脚肚生一疮，久遂成漏，百药不效，自度必死。一村人见之曰∶此鳝漏也。以锻石温泡、熏洗、觉痒即是也。洗不数次，遂愈）蚀恶肉，无瘢疵（和药点痣）解酒酸（酒家多用之，然有灰之酒伤人），内用止泻痢、崩带，收阴挺（阴肉挺出，亦名阴菌，或产后玉门不闭。熬黄水泡，澄清暖洗）、脱肛，消积聚、结核。风化者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153834-7fddj8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153834-7fddj8v","updated":"20240612153834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"圹灰，火毒已出，主顽疮、脓水淋漓，敛口尤妙。"}]},{"ID":"20240612154218-01gpgbn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612154218-01gpgbn"}},{"ID":"20240612154219-o7fzdch","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612154219-o7fzdch","updated":"20240612154228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612154219-i6jaasx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154219-i6jaasx","updated":"20240612154219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，温，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612154219-nt4swo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154219-nt4swo9","updated":"20240612154219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主疽疡疥瘙，热气恶疮，癞疾死肌，堕眉，杀痔虫，去黑子息肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612154219-lvlfk7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154219-lvlfk7o","updated":"20240612154219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔发明〕石灰禀壮火之余烈，故能辟除阴邪湿毒，观《本经》所主疽疡疥瘙，热气恶疮，癞疾死肌等，皆外治之用。去黑子者，火气未散，性能灼物，故能去黑子息肉及堕眉也。《本经》虽不言有毒，而内服之方从无及此，其毒可知。寇氏治中风口，以石灰醋炒调涂，左涂右，右涂左，立便牵正。《千金》治身面疣，用苦酒浸石灰六七日，取汁频频滴之自落。又治溺死之人，用化过细灰裹下部，以渗其水即活。又治瘘疮不合，古冢中石灰厚敷之。《集玄方》治面靥疣痣，碱水煮滚化矿灰，插糯米拌入灰中，经宿色变如晶，以针微拨动，点少许于上，半日汁出，剔去药，不得著水，二日即愈。《便简方》治痄腮肿痛，醋调陈年石灰敷之。《肘后方》治汤火伤灼，年久石灰，油调敷之。又治刀刃金疮，石灰裹之，即痛定血止，但不可著水，著水即烂肉也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612154350-ly8ownp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612154350-ly8ownp"}},{"ID":"20240612154351-to6qvsn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612154351-to6qvsn","updated":"20240612154359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰《本草详节》"}]},{"ID":"20240612154351-d6y7d2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154351-d6y7d2e","updated":"20240612154351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（附：古墓中石灰、艌船油石灰）"}]},{"ID":"20240612154351-ueb19wz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154351-ueb19wz","updated":"20240612154351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，气温。有毒。伏雄黄、硫黄、硇砂，去锡晕。凡使，煎膏，不入汤药。"}]},{"ID":"20240612154351-8u9xx6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154351-8u9xx6l","updated":"20240612154351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主疽疡，疥瘙，恶疮，癞疾，白癜，骨疽，杀痔虫，蚀恶肉，点痣，堕胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612154351-wygzbtz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154351-wygzbtz","updated":"20240612154351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附：古墓中石灰，棺下者佳。主顽疮，瘻疮，脓水淋漓，敛诸疮口。"}]},{"ID":"20240612154351-f467fth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154351-f467fth","updated":"20240612154351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附：艌船油石灰，主金疮，跌扑伤损，破皮出血，及诸疮瘻，血风臁疮，软疖，止血，杀虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612154351-aeqsyx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154351-aeqsyx2","updated":"20240612154351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按：石灰，能止血，但不可著水，著水即烂肉。龚云林单以古墓石灰，水飞为丸，治青筋沙症，谓能顺气化血，散痰消滞，并治带下、打扑，或久患赤白痢疾，屡著神效，盖入土既久，烈性尽化，故有如是之能也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153622-zfkixui","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153622-zfkixui"}},{"ID":"20240612153820-kbcjv2t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-kbcjv2t","updated":"20240612153827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-08qhib7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-08qhib7","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦名石垩、垩灰、希灰、煅石、白虎、矿灰。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-hc9p4ar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-hc9p4ar","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」辛、温、有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-pt5j91f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-pt5j91f","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-a2burdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-a2burdz","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、中风口。用新石灰，醋炒后，调如泥，涂口侧。口向左歪，涂右边；口向右歪，涂左边。很快奶可牵正。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-zy9w89d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-zy9w89d","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、风牙肿痛。用放了两年的陈石灰、细辛，等分为末，擦牙。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-xjau8aa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-xjau8aa","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、虫牙。用石灰和沙糖塞在牙中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-u94xk0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-u94xk0c","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、干霍乱（按：症象是欲吐吐不出，欲不出，心腹胀痛，烦闷欲死）。用多年的陈石灰，以沙糖沙漠中淡醋汤调服二钱。此方名“落盏汤”。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-5qjh5m4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-5qjh5m4","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、偏坠气痛。用陈石灰（炒过）、五陪子、山栀子，等分为末，加面粉和醋调敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-kb7fpb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-kb7fpb9","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、白带白淫。用风化石灰一两、白茯苓三两，共研细，加糊成丸，如梧子大。每服二、三十丸，空心服，米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-jp8ndsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-jp8ndsr","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、酒积下痢。用石灰五两，和水成球，外包黄泥，在火里烧煅一天一夜。去泥，研细，加醋和面粉，做成丸子，如梧子大。每服三十丸，空心服，姜汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-l5fkoaq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-l5fkoaq","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、十年血痢。用石灰三升，熬黄。溶在一斗水里。等澄清后，每次饮此水一升，一天饮三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-mfjuhvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-mfjuhvr","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、虚冷脱肛。用石灰烧热，裹在布里，让病人坐在上面，冷了便换，有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-owkzc5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-owkzc5p","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、产后产门不闭，或阴道脱出。用石灰一斗，熬黄，加水二斗，澄清后熏下部。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-nuualh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-nuualh1","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11、腹胁积块。用石灰半斤，盛瓦罐里炒至极热，加大黄末一两，炒红取出，再加桂末半两，略烧，加入米醋和成膏子，摊在布上贴患处。内服消块药。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-4uazjm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-4uazjm8","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12、发落不止。用石灰三升，水拌炒焦，泡在三升酒中，每服三合，常令酒气相接，则新发更生。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-nn0lqmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-nn0lqmy","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13、脸上黑痣。用水调石灰一碗，把完好的糯米若干粒半插石灰中，半露石灰外。过一夜，米色变如玻璃。治疗时，先以针轻拔黑痣，点少许玻璃状米粉在痣上。半天后，痣内有汁水流出，须挑去米粉，痣处两天不沾水，即愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-gko153h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-gko153h","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14、疔疮恶肿。用石灰、半夏，等分为末，敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-xl0othc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-xl0othc","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"15、痰核恶肿（状如瘰疬，红肿发热，有时恶寒）。用石灰火煅为末，和白果肉同捣，贴患处；蜜调亦可。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-p976m7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-p976m7f","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16、痄（按：即腮腺炎，一作痄腮）。用醋调石灰敷肿痛处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-aahkxf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-aahkxf8","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17、多年恶疮。用陈石灰，研细，加鸡蛋清调成泥，煅过，再研。以姜汁调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-jbulnvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-jbulnvy","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"18、丹毒。用醋和石灰涂之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-4sdyma7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-4sdyma7","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"19、风疹。治法同上。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-3h6h6ds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-3h6h6ds","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20、痱子。用石灰一两（煅过）、蛤粉二两、甘草一两，共研为末，作扑粉扑痱子上。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-up4283y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-up4283y","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"21、汤火灼伤。陈石灰粉扑伤处，或加油调涂亦可。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-vwt3f2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-vwt3f2k","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"22、打伤肿痛。用新石灰粉加麻油调搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-ra4mbcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-ra4mbcf","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"23、刀伤。用石灰粉敷上，外用布裹，能止痛、止血，也好得快。如伤口很深，可稍加滑石粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-r5cwisc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-r5cwisc","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"24、误吞金属物。用石灰加一小块硫磺（如皂角子大），共研细，酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153820-2y8c2ha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153820-2y8c2ha","updated":"20240612153820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"25、虫咬伤。用醋调石灰涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612154041-swl6dgd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612154041-swl6dgd"}},{"ID":"20240612154049-lyoblzo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612154049-lyoblzo","updated":"20240612154058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612154043-rnkqpqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154043-rnkqpqg","updated":"20240612154043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温。主疽疡疥瘙，热气恶疮，癞疾，死肌，堕眉。杀痔虫，去黑子息肉。疗髓骨疽。一名恶灰。一名希灰。生中山川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612154043-9sbu34t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154043-9sbu34t","updated":"20240612154043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（陶隐居云：中山属代郡。今近山生石，青白色，作灶烧竟，以水沃之，即热蒸而解末矣。性至烈，人以度酒饮之，则腹痛下痢。疗金疮亦甚良。俗名石垩。古今多以构冢，用捍水而辟虫。故古冢中水，洗诸疮，皆即瘥。唐本注云：《别录》及今人用疗金疮，止血，大效。若五月五日采蘩蒌、葛叶、鹿活草、槲叶、芍药、地黄叶、苍耳叶、青蒿叶合石灰，捣为团如鸡卵，曝干，末，以疗疮生肌，大神验。今按：别本注云：烧青石为灰也，有两种：风化，水化。风化为胜。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本云：有毒，堕胎。《药性论》云：石灰，治[疒/呙]疥，蚀恶肉，不入汤服。止金疮血，和鸡子白，败船茹，甚良。日华子：云：味甘，无毒。生肌长肉，止血，并主白癜，疬疡，瘢疵等。疗冷气，妇人粉刺，痔瘘疽疮，瘿赘疣子。又治产后阴不能合，浓煎汁熏洗。解酒味酸，令不坏。治酒毒，暖水脏，倍胜炉灰。又名煅石。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612154043-sfvngfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154043-sfvngfp","updated":"20240612154043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（《图经》曰：石灰，生中山川谷，今所在近山处皆有之。此烧青石为灰也，又名石煅。有两种：风化，水化。风化者，取煅了石，置风中自解，此为有力。水化者以水沃之，则热蒸而解，力差劣。古方多用合百草团末，治金创殊胜。今医家或以腊月黄牛胆，取汁搜和，却内胆中，挂之当风百日，研之，更胜草叶者。又败船茹灰刮取用亦同。又冬灰，生方谷川泽。浣衣黄灰，烧诸蒿藜积聚炼作之。今用灰多杂薪蒸，乃不善，惟桑薪灰，纯者入药绝奇。古方以诸灰杂石灰熬煎，以点疣、痣、黑子等。丹灶亦用之。又煅铁灶中灰，主坚积。古方二车丸用之。灶中对釜月下黄土，名伏龙肝。灶额上墨，名百草霜，并主消化积滞。今人下食药中多用之。铛下墨、梁上尘，并主金创。屋尘煤，治齿龈肿出血。东壁土，主下部疮，脱肛，皆医家常用。故并见此，伤寒黑效丸：用釜底墨、灶突墨、梁上尘三物，同合诸药，盖其功用，亦相近矣。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612154043-llnfyii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154043-llnfyii","updated":"20240612154043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云：凡使，用醋浸一宿，漉出待干，下火煅，令腥秽气出，用瓶盛著，密盖，放冷，拭上灰，令净，细研用。《圣惠方》：治蝼蛄咬人，用石灰醋和涂之。又方：治大肠久积虚冷，每因大便脱肛，挼不得入方：炒石灰令热，故帛裹，坐其上，冷即易之。《外台秘要》：元希声侍郎治卒发疹秘验方：石灰随多少，和醋、浆水调涂，随手即减。《千金方》：治眉发髭落。石灰三升，右以水拌令匀，焰火炒令焦，以绢袋贮，使好酒一斗渍之，密封，冬十四日，春秋七日。取服一合，常令酒气相接，服之百日，即新髭发生，不落。又方：治瘘疮。取古冢中石灰，傅厚调涂之。《肘后方》：治产后阴道开不闭。石灰一斗熬之，以水二斗投灰中，适寒温，入水中坐，须臾更作。又方：治汤火灼疮。石灰细筛，水和涂之，干即易。又方：治金刃所伤，急以石灰裹之，既止痛，又速愈。无石灰，灰亦可用。疮若深，未宜速合者，以滑石傅之。《经验方》：治蚯蚓虫咬，其形如大风，眉须皆落。以石灰水浸身亦良。《梅师方》：治产后阴肿，下脱肠出，玉门不闭。取石灰一斗，熬令黄，以水三斗投灰中，放冷澄清，取一斗三升暖洗。又方：治金疮止血速瘥方：炒石灰和鸡子白，和丸如弹子大，炭火煅赤，捣末，以傅疮上，立瘥。《孙用和方》：治误吞金银或钱，在腹内不下方：石灰一杏核大，硫黄一皂子大，同研为末，酒调下，不计时候服。《孙真人食忌》：治疥淋、石灰汁洗之。又方：去靥子。取石灰炭上熬令热，插糯米於灰上，候米化，即取米点之。《斗门方》：治刀斧伤。用石灰上包，定痛止血佳，瘥。又方：治中风，口面斜。向右即於左边涂之，向左即於右边涂之，候才正如旧，即须以水洗下，大妙。崔氏：治血痢十年方：石灰三升熬令黄，以水一斗搅令清澄。一服一升，日三服。《抱朴子·内篇》：古大墓中多石灰汁，夏月行人有疮者，见墓中清水，用自洗浴，疮自愈。于是诸病者闻之，悉往洗之，传有人饮之以中病。《新唐书·李百药传》：百药劝杜伏威朝京师，既至历阳中，悔欲杀之，饮以石灰酒，因大利，顿欲死，既而宿病皆愈。《丹房镜源》云：石灰伏硫黄，去锡上晕，制雄黄，制硇砂可用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612154043-mztqalc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612154043-mztqalc","updated":"20240612154043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（《衍义》曰：石灰，水调一盏，如稠粥，拣好糯米粒全者，半置灰中，半灰外。经宿，灰中米色变如水精。若人手面上有黑黡子及纹刺，先微微以针头拨动，置少许如水精者於其上，经半日许，黡汁自出。剔去药不用，且不得着水，三二日愈。又取新硬石灰一合，以醋炒，调如泥，於患偏风牵口邪入口唇上，不患处一边涂之，立便牵正。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153622-b6jda4a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153622-b6jda4a"}},{"ID":"20240612153636-n8ls8kj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153636-n8ls8kj","updated":"20240612153650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153636-zox64yv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153636-zox64yv","updated":"20240612153639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】本品为石灰石类矿物【】烧而成的块状物，或再经吸取水分而得的粉状物。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153636-rbosyc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153636-rbosyc6","updated":"20240612153636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛，温。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153636-rc8zob8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153636-rc8zob8","updated":"20240612153636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】解毒，止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153636-bwtqzbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153636-bwtqzbu","updated":"20240612153636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】外用于汤火烫伤，创伤出血等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153636-ajrueum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153636-ajrueum","updated":"20240612153636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品有较强的解毒和止血作用，用风化石灰一斤，加水四碗，浸泡，搅拌，澄清后，吹去水面浮衣，取中间清水，每水一份加麻油一份，调成乳状，搽涂汤火伤处；又陈石灰研末，可作刀伤止血药用。此外，本品还可用以腐蚀赘疣、黑痔。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153636-9q53ysf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153636-9q53ysf","updated":"20240612153636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】生石灰（用以腐蚀赘疣、黑痔）。熟石灰、陈石灰（用于烫伤）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153636-70e9vg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153636-70e9vg9","updated":"20240612153636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】外用适量，不作内服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153636-vziqd7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153636-vziqd7r","updated":"20240612153636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】桃衣散《外科正宗》：风化石灰、生大黄。外用治创伤出血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153636-b4q8al6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153636-b4q8al6","updated":"20240612153636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《本经》：「主疽疥瘙，热气恶疮，窥疾，死肌堕眉，杀痔虫，去黑子息肉。」"}]},{"ID":"20240612153636-fvjy2l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153636-fvjy2l0","updated":"20240612153636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草纲目》：「散血定痛，上水泻血病....。」又云：「石灰，止血....，但不可着水，着水即烂肉。」"}]},{"ID":"20240612153622-fc2ivwp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153622-fc2ivwp"}},{"ID":"20240612153623-mhufn83","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-mhufn83","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：石灰"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-opil3by","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-opil3by","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-50svmnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-50svmnf","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shí Huī"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-4j0628z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-4j0628z","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-glvpv6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-glvpv6u","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 垩灰（《本经》），希灰（《别录》），石垩（陶弘景），染灰、散灰、白灰、味灰（《石药尔雅》），锻石（《日华子本草》），石锻（《本草图经》），矿灰（《纲目》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-0llyp6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-0llyp6z","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-ky91vyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-ky91vyq","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-0greyo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-0greyo0","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-gt18hhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-gt18hhw","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"石灰岩经加热煅烧而成"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-vrkyphl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-vrkyphl","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-1o3l9cs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-1o3l9cs","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主要由方解石所组成，为致密块状体。光泽暗淡，呈土状或石头光泽。颜色变化甚大，视其所含杂质的种类及多少而定。透明度也较差。非常致密时多呈贝状断口。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-5dvhz5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-5dvhz5t","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-7vhq7nr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-7vhq7nr","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①生石灰"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-8o4tnjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-8o4tnjo","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为不规则的块状物，白色或灰白色，不透明。质硬。粉末白色。易溶于酸，微溶于水。暴露在空气中吸收水分后，则逐渐风化而成熟石灰。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-0w7qy8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-0w7qy8r","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②熟石灰"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-k954hbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-k954hbr","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：消石灰。为白色或灰白色粉末，偶见块状物。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-h6obgq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-h6obgq7","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-nhgerp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-nhgerp4","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 石灰岩主要成分是碳酸钙，常见夹杂物为硅酸、铁、铝、镁等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-4qn0grb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-4qn0grb","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石灰岩加高热，则发生二氧化碳而遗留氧化钙，即生石灰（石灰）。生石灰遇水，则成消石灰，成分是氢氧化钙。生石灰或消石灰露于大气中，不断吸收大气中的二氧化碳而成碳酸钙；因此，石灰陈久，成分都成为碳酸钙。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-gnk3iko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-gnk3iko","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-cenav7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-cenav7p","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草求真》：\"入肝、脾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-gq9fr1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-gq9fr1c","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草撮要》：\"入手足太阴、厥阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-xv9ha4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-xv9ha4g","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-h2vl7af","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-h2vl7af","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，温，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-c14kayd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-c14kayd","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味辛，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-it811vk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-it811vk","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《蜀本草》：\"有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-lwzxn4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-lwzxn4y","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"味甘，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-yswl69s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-yswl69s","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-y5fxmxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-y5fxmxm","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 燥湿，杀虫，止血，定痛，蚀恶肉。治疥癣，湿疮，创伤出血，汤火烫伤，痔疮，脱肛，赘疣。内服止泻痢，崩带。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-qqxt14g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-qqxt14g","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主疽疡疥瘙，热气恶疮，癞疾死肌堕眉，杀痔虫，去黑子息肉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-g7idy2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-g7idy2u","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗髓骨疽。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-t2p0l11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-t2p0l11","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"治瘑疥，蚀恶肉，不入汤服，止金疮血，和鸡于白、败船茹甚良。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-8kj2q4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-8kj2q4c","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"生肌长肉，止血，并主白癜、疬疡、瘢疵等，疗冷气，痔瘘疽疮，瘿瘤疣子。又治产后阴不能合，浓煎汁熏洗。治酒毒，暖水脏。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-vl79w6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-vl79w6w","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》：\"散血定痛，止水泻血肉，白带白淫，收脱肛阴挺，消积聚结核，贴口喝，黑须发。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-6bvi1zi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-6bvi1zi","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《医林纂要》：\"泻心坚肾，破瘀攻积，敛肺清金，杀虫解毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-l2zf3ls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-l2zf3ls","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-gcsif8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-gcsif8d","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用：研末调敷，或以水溶化澄清涂洗。内服：入丸、散，或加水溶解取澄清液服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-csf779n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-csf779n","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-7ag0w6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-7ag0w6m","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疥：淋石灰汁洗之。（《孙真人食忌》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-46bdlgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-46bdlgv","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治夏月痱子及热疮：葛粉一（三）两，石灰一两（微炒），甘草二两（生用为末）。上药相和，研令匀，用绵扑之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-1mbqomy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-1mbqomy","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治卒发疹：石灰随多少和醋浆水调涂。（《元希声秘验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-0wr78r2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-0wr78r2","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治外伤性出血：陈石灰二两，冰片二钱，白矾二钱（煅）。将石灰炒黄，加入冰片及白矾，研成细末，撒于创面包扎即可。（徐州市《单方验方新医疗法选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-v9x2coy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-v9x2coy","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治痔疾，肛门边肿硬，痒痛不可忍：风化石灰三两，芫花三两，灶突内黑煤二两，上药捣罗为末，分作两分于铫子内点醋炒，侯梢热，以帛裹熨之，冷则再换。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-8d0xb1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-8d0xb1k","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治大肠久积虚冷，每因大便脱肛，不能收入：石灰熬令热，以故帛裹，坐其上，冷即换。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-4emngez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-4emngez","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治偏坠气痛：陈石灰（炒）、五倍子、山栀子等分。为末，面和醋调敷之。（《医方摘要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-qgmic3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-qgmic3g","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧去疣目：苦酒渍石灰六、七日，取汁滴点疣上。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-2brlumm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-2brlumm","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治痄腮肿痛：醋调石灰敷之。（《简便单方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-dirnmha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-dirnmha","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治痰核红肿寒热，状如瘰疬：石灰火煅为末，以白果肉同捣贴之，蜜调亦可。（《活人心统》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-zdlkvx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-zdlkvx6","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治疔肿：石灰三分，马齿菜二分。上二味捣，以鸡子白和敷之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-9t9ekds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-9t9ekds","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治痢血数十年：石灰三大升，炒令黄，以水一斗搅，令澄清，一服一升，三服。（《外台》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-ce75ias","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-ce75ias","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治白带白淫及水泻不止：风化石灰一两，白茯苓三两。为末，糊丸梧子大。每服二、三十九，空心米饮下。（《集玄方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-5w7c4cr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-5w7c4cr","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治腹胁积块：风化石灰半斤，瓦器炒极热，入大黄末一两，炒红取起，入桂末半两，略烧，入米醋和成膏，摊绢上贴之，内服消块药，甚效。（《丹溪心法》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-qjjp8sv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-qjjp8sv","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-rlh81gm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-rlh81gm","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗慢性气管炎"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-aaxs6ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-aaxs6ym","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取石灰0.5斤，加净水5斤，搅拌后沉淀24小时，取上清液，过滤。日服3次，每次20～30毫升。或再取黄芩0.5斤，水煎两次去渣，将药液浓缩至200毫升左右，加入石灰液中，使成2000毫升，黄芩含量约10％。日服3次，每次20～30毫升。共治疗162例，经4个月追访，痊愈2例，显效36例，好转112例，无效12例。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-ll8bb68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-ll8bb68","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗下肢溃疡"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-pzp2lup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-pzp2lup","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取陈石灰去浮污后研威细末，撒布创面。用时先将创面清洗干净；上药后再用硼酸油膏敷料外贴。如创口湿水淋漓，单用药粉即可。对久不收口的外伤，破烂的冻伤、烫伤等亦有疗效。经治200余例，均有效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-oiubs6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-oiubs6q","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗烧烫伤"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-4v3xafz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-4v3xafz","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取生石灰1斤放入盆内，加凉开水1250毫升，待石灰潮解成糊状时，将盆轻轻振荡使石灰沉底，取上层无渣石灰乳约500克，加入鸡蛋清8个搅拌成胶冻样，再加香油60毫升，拌匀即得\"石灰乳膏\"。使用时先用镊子将伤面浮皮拉平，水泡焦痂不要动，亦不用任何药液消毒；取大于伤面的纱布3～4层，摊上1～1.5厘米厚的石灰乳膏，贴于伤面，包扎固定，松紧适宜。48小时后药膏即凝固定型。如伤在颈部、腋下、腘窝时，上药要厚，包扎后在48小时内伤部不要屈曲，以防乳膏脱落，皮肤粘连。10～15天拆除纱布和石灰乳膏，可见水泡吸收，焦痂自行脱落。此时伤面剧痒，但不宜搔抓。乳膏干后，伤面有紧缩感，可用香油在纱布外面涂抹。对烧烫面积较大，伤面已感染的病人，要及时控制感染，防止休克，保持水和电解质的平衡。另据报道，用熟石灰粉500克，加冷开水l000毫升，搅匀静置，滤取其澄清液，与等量花生油（煮沸待冷）混合后，即制成烫伤油。用时将油摇匀，涂抹患处。治疗72例，其中Ⅰ°48例，用药1～3次后全部治愈；Ⅱ°21例，用药2～3次即治愈9例，3次以上治愈12例；Ⅲ°3例，经10～30次后亦全部治愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-0sbszkl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-0sbszkl","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治疗头癣"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-2a1aeo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-2a1aeo7","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取刚风化的石灰半碗，加水至1碗，搅拌后沉淀3分钟，取上层乳状液，加入桐油约4滴，用力搅拌，去多余水分使成膏状，外搽患部。治疗60余例，一般只搽数次即见效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-37dgvw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-37dgvw0","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-04souih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-04souih","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-6xmulzy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-6xmulzy","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：石灰"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-gyue7jw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-gyue7jw","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-cogrtxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-cogrtxs","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shí Huī"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-bwvjkj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-bwvjkj0","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-w787cf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-w787cf8","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 垩灰、希灰、石垩、五味、染灰、散灰、白灰、味灰、锻石、石锻、矿灰、白虎"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-8sxde8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-8sxde8h","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-obzv1qj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-obzv1qj","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lime-stone， Lime"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-y4036zl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-y4036zl","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-07l7oy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-07l7oy7","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自1.《本经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-672qpuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-672qpuv","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.陶弘景：石灰，今近山生石，青白色，作灶烧竟，以水沃之，即热蒸而解末矣。性至烈，人以度酒饮之，则腹痛下痢。疗金疮亦甚良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-e8g8dou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-e8g8dou","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《唐本草》：石灰，《名医别录》及今人用疗金疮止血大效。若五月采蘩缕、葛叶、鹿活草、槲叶、芍药、地黄叶、苍耳叶、青蒿叶，合石灰捣为团如鸡卵，暴干，末，以疗疮生肌，大验。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-k4gfgg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-k4gfgg4","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草图经》：石灰，今所在近山处皆有之，此烧青石为灰也。又名石"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-fjp2vuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-fjp2vuh","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-ynt389b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-ynt389b","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为石灰岩经加热煅烧而成的生石灰，及其水化产物熟石灰，即羟钙石，或两者的混合物。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-3qe8r92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-3qe8r92","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Limestone;Lime;Portlandite"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-cukqgg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-cukqgg0","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-43bgxm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-43bgxm5","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：全国各地均有产出。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-wstb9cw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-wstb9cw","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：石灰，尤其熟石灰，在长期存放中，若与空气中二氧化碳接触，可形成方解石，并与熟石灰共存。故陈年石灰中含细分散的碳酸钙。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-w1iehh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-w1iehh6","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-cr0gaob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-cr0gaob","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.石灰岩 主要由方解石所组成，为致密块状体。白色或灰白色，由所含杂质成分差异，颜色变化甚大。如含铁质则呈褐色，含有机质时呈灰至黑色。土状光泽，透明度较差。非常致密时多呈贝状断口。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-e3iv1lo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-e3iv1lo","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.石灰 晶体结构属等轴晶系。为粒状致密块体，罕见有立方体或八面体状单晶。白色，或带灰白、灰黄等色调。土状光泽。硬度3.5。相对密度3.3。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-few6q9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-few6q9w","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.晶本结构属三方晶系。粉末状疏松块体，极罕见其细鳞片状晶体。白或灰白色。土状光泽。硬度2。相对密度2.23。易溶于热盐酸。在水中的溶解度与温度有关。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-dync90u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-dync90u","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-cio6eax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-cio6eax","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 （1）生石灰 主为不规则块状，大小不一，表面有微细裂缝，多孔。白色或灰色；条痕白色。不透明。土状光泽。体较轻，质硬，易砸碎，断面粉状。以块状、色白、无杂石及其他杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-0jfj5bl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-0jfj5bl","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）熟石灰 为粉末状或为疏松块体，白色或淡灰白色，土状光泽。以粉细、色白、无硬块者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-hkjg8pi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-hkjg8pi","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-ug0j45i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-ug0j45i","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生石灰为氧化钙(CaO),熟石灰为氢氧化钙[Ca(OH2)]。生石灰或熟石灰露于大气中，不断吸收大气中的二氧化碳而成碳酸钙(CaCO3)，因此石灰陈久，成分都变为碳酸钙。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-b9gb9zj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-b9gb9zj","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-szl29in","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-szl29in","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.生石在具吸水性，可作干燥剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-39xlqqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-39xlqqb","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.石灰水具碱性，可制液碱、漂白粉等。有抑菌、消毒、杀虫、去污等作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-9hix35t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-9hix35t","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-i6xq1ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-i6xq1ss","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.净制：采得石灰岩矿石，择较洁净者，除去尘土上等杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-wdcp7w6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-wdcp7w6","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.煅制：作窑煅烧，柴煤一层置下，矿石一层置上，火从下发，层层自焚而散(900℃以上高温)，取出，去夹石等杂物。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-e7py4e4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-e7py4e4","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-x6iz8r2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-x6iz8r2","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）取生石灰1块，加入水，生成氢氧化钙并放出大量热量。（检查钙盐）（2）取本品粉末约0.2g，加入稀盐酸5ml，使其溶解，滤过。①取铂丝，用盐酸湿润后，蘸取滤液，在无色火焰中燃烧，火焰即显砖红色。（检查钙盐）②取滤液1ml，加甲基红指示液2滴，用氨试液中和，再滴加盐酸至恰呈酸性，加草酸铵试液，即生成白色沉淀。（检查钙盐）"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-1f1oyim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-1f1oyim","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-p7y3b32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-p7y3b32","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；脾"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-yq65pm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-yq65pm3","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-xkxmcth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-xkxmcth","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛；苦；涩；温；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-hrtbinv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-hrtbinv","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-aggvlc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-aggvlc4","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 凡有实火，胃热者及孕妇者皆禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-i9y6os8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-i9y6os8","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-5m2g2qt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-5m2g2qt","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解毒蚀腐；敛疮止血；杀虫止痒。主痈疽疔疮；丹毒；瘰疬痰核；下肢溃疡；创伤出血；汤火烫伤；久痢脱肛；赘疣；疥癣；湿疹；痱子"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-mhgiqid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-mhgiqid","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-msya9fx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-msya9fx","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：入丸、散，或加水溶解取澄清液服。外用：研末调敷，或以水溶化澄清涂洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-oxw33tk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-oxw33tk","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-es0dc6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-es0dc6u","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生石灰性偏燥热，只为外用；以燥湿杀虫为长；熟石灰性偏辛温，即可外治(功似生石灰)，亦可炮制内服，以止痢止带为优。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-2zznt0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-2zznt0f","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-1x2etiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-1x2etiu","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草经疏》：石灰，《本经》不言其毒，观所主皆不入汤，其为毒可知矣。火气未散，性能灼物，故主去黑子息肉及堕眉也。其主疽疡疥瘙，热气恶疮，癞疾死肌，髓骨疽者，皆风热毒气浸淫于骨肉皮肤之间，辛温能散风热毒气，且能蚀去恶肉而生新肌，故为诸疮肿要药也。辛而燥，故又能杀痔虫。古方多用合百草团末治金疮殊胜者，以其性能坚物，使不腐坏，且血见石灰，则止，而百草又能活血凉血故也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-df8uozw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-df8uozw","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《医林纂要》：石灰，辛能散能行，苦能降能坚，涩能收能止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-9rt9llm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-9rt9llm","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经》：主疽疡疥瘙，热气恶疮，癞疾死肌堕眉，杀痔虫，去黑子息肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-1bliujc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-1bliujc","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《别录》：疗髓骨疽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-3r6706r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-3r6706r","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《药性论》：治疥，蚀恶肉，不入汤服，止金疮血，和鸡子白、败船茹甚良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-qaliev0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-qaliev0","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《日华子本草》：生肌长肉，止血，并主白癜、疬疡、瘢疵等，疗冷气，痔瘘疽疮，瘿瘤疣子。又治产后阴不能合，浓煎汁熏洗，治酒毒，暖水脏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-ld8j00s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-ld8j00s","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.纲目》：散血定痛，止水泻血痢，白带白淫，收脱肛阴挺，消积聚结核，贴口wo，黑须发。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-0a3750v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-0a3750v","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《医林纂要》：泻心坚肾，破瘀攻积，敛肺清金，杀虫解毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-l09lby8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-l09lby8","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612153623-uh5a4u7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153623-uh5a4u7","updated":"20240612153623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612153624-2ckkpbr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612153624-2ckkpbr"}},{"ID":"20240612153625-pxy3u0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612153625-pxy3u0a"}}]}